<codeline><highlight class="normal">#<sp/>Falling<sp/>Sand</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">**Falling<sp/>Sand**<sp/>is<sp/>a<sp/>real-time<sp/>**2D<sp/>falling-sand<sp/>/<sp/>cellular<sp/>automata**<sp/>sandbox<sp/>for<sp/>Windows.<sp/>You<sp/>paint<sp/>ten<sp/>materials<sp/>onto<sp/>a<sp/>**384×224**<sp/>cell<sp/>grid;<sp/>**granular<sp/>solids**<sp/>fall,<sp/>**gases**<sp/>rise,<sp/>**liquids**<sp/>are<sp/>solved<sp/>with<sp/>a<sp/>GPU<sp/>pressure–flux<sp/>pipeline,<sp/>and<sp/>**thermal<sp/>chemistry**<sp/>drives<sp/>fire,<sp/>smoke,<sp/>steam,<sp/>melting,<sp/>and<sp/>quenching.<sp/>The<sp/>simulation<sp/>and<sp/>renderer<sp/>run<sp/>almost<sp/>entirely<sp/>on<sp/>the<sp/>**Vulkan<sp/>1.3**<sp/>device<sp/>via<sp/>**GLSL<sp/>460**<sp/>compute<sp/>and<sp/>graphics<sp/>shaders;<sp/>the<sp/>host<sp/>is<sp/>**C++23**<sp/>with<sp/>a<sp/>native<sp/>**Win32**<sp/>window<sp/>and<sp/>an<sp/>immediate-mode<sp/>pixel<sp/>UI<sp/>composited<sp/>in<sp/>a<sp/>second<sp/>draw<sp/>pass.</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">Default<sp/>startup<sp/>scene<sp/>is<sp/>**Thermal**<sp/>(`Scene::thermal`).<sp/>The<sp/>intro<sp/>blurb<sp/>in<sp/>older<sp/>docs<sp/>referred<sp/>to<sp/>“Thermal<sp/>Vent”<sp/>—<sp/>that<sp/>preset<sp/>matches<sp/>`layouts/thermal.json`.</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
