<codeline><highlight class="normal">##<sp/>Features<sp/>{#features}</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">-<sp/>**Ten<sp/>paintable<sp/>materials**<sp/>(sand,<sp/>water,<sp/>oil,<sp/>stone,<sp/>wood,<sp/>fire,<sp/>smoke,<sp/>steam,<sp/>lava,<sp/>ice)<sp/>plus<sp/>empty<sp/>cells<sp/>for<sp/>erase.</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">-<sp/>**Four<sp/>built-in<sp/>scenes**<sp/>loaded<sp/>from<sp/>JSON<sp/>(`waterworks`,<sp/>`thermal`,<sp/>`refinery`,<sp/>`empty`).</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">-<sp/>**GPU<sp/>simulation**<sp/>at<sp/>**90<sp/>Hz**<sp/>during<sp/>play<sp/>(fixed<sp/>`simulationHz`),<sp/>with<sp/>pause<sp/>and<sp/>single-step.</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">-<sp/>**Brush<sp/>painting**,<sp/>**erase**<sp/>(right<sp/>mouse),<sp/>and<sp/>**stir**<sp/>(middle<sp/>mouse)<sp/>implemented<sp/>in<sp/>`brush.comp`.</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">-<sp/>**Instanced<sp/>HUD**:<sp/>material<sp/>palette,<sp/>scene<sp/>tabs,<sp/>transport<sp/>controls,<sp/>FPS/GPU<sp/>badge,<sp/>brush<sp/>size<sp/>track,<sp/>pause/settings<sp/>overlays<sp/>(`ui.cpp`<sp/>→<sp/>`ui.vert`<sp/>/<sp/>`ui.frag`).</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">-<sp/>**Save/load**<sp/>of<sp/>cell<sp/>state<sp/>to<sp/>a<sp/>binary<sp/>sandbox<sp/>file<sp/>under<sp/>`%LOCALAPPDATA%\FallingSand\world.sandbox`<sp/>(or<sp/>current-directory<sp/>fallback).</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
