<codeline><highlight class="normal">##<sp/>Requirements<sp/>{#requirements}</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">|<sp/>Component<sp/>|<sp/>Version<sp/>/<sp/>notes<sp/>|</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">|<sp/>---<sp/>|<sp/>---<sp/>|</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">|<sp/>OS<sp/>|<sp/>**Windows<sp/>x64**<sp/>only<sp/>(`CMakeLists.txt`<sp/>rejects<sp/>non-Win32).<sp/>|</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">|<sp/>CMake<sp/>|<sp/>**3.28+**<sp/>|</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">|<sp/>Compiler<sp/>|<sp/>**Visual<sp/>Studio<sp/>2022**<sp/>(x64),<sp/>C++23<sp/>(`/W4`,<sp/>static<sp/>MSVC<sp/>runtime<sp/>in<sp/>Release)<sp/>|</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">|<sp/>Vulkan<sp/>|<sp/>**1.3**<sp/>instance/device,<sp/>`glslc`<sp/>from<sp/>the<sp/>Vulkan<sp/>SDK<sp/>(`Vulkan::Vulkan`<sp/>+<sp/>`glslc`<sp/>target)<sp/>|</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">|<sp/>GPU<sp/>|<sp/>Compute<sp/>workgroups<sp/>up<sp/>to<sp/>**16×16**,<sp/>**≥10**<sp/>storage<sp/>buffers<sp/>per<sp/>stage,<sp/>timestamp<sp/>queries<sp/>optional<sp/>|</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">Runtime:<sp/>place<sp/>**`FallingSand.exe`**<sp/>next<sp/>to<sp/>copied<sp/>**`shaders/`**<sp/>(SPIR-V)<sp/>and<sp/>**`layouts/`**<sp/>(JSON).<sp/>CMake<sp/>target<sp/>`sand_shaders`<sp/>and<sp/>`sand_layouts`<sp/>copy<sp/>these<sp/>into<sp/>`build/&lt;Config&gt;/`<sp/>automatically.</highlight></codeline>
