<codeline><highlight class="normal">##<sp/>Controls<sp/>and<sp/>UI<sp/>{#controls-and-ui}</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">###<sp/>Mouse</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">|<sp/>Input<sp/>|<sp/>Effect<sp/>|</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">|<sp/>---<sp/>|<sp/>---<sp/>|</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">|<sp/>**Left<sp/>button**<sp/>|<sp/>Paint<sp/>on<sp/>canvas<sp/>(selected<sp/>material)<sp/>or<sp/>click<sp/>HUD<sp/>controls.<sp/>|</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">|<sp/>**Right<sp/>button**<sp/>|<sp/>Erase<sp/>to<sp/>empty<sp/>on<sp/>canvas.<sp/>|</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">|<sp/>**Middle<sp/>button**<sp/>|<sp/>**Stir**<sp/>—<sp/>`brush.comp`<sp/>mixes<sp/>liquids<sp/>along<sp/>the<sp/>stroke<sp/>(`Stroke::stir`).<sp/>|</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">|<sp/>**Wheel**<sp/>|<sp/>Adjust<sp/>brush<sp/>radius<sp/>(`minRadius`<sp/>2<sp/>…<sp/>`maxRadius`<sp/>32).<sp/>|</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">###<sp/>Keyboard</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">|<sp/>Key<sp/>|<sp/>Effect<sp/>|</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">|<sp/>---<sp/>|<sp/>---<sp/>|</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">|<sp/>`1`–`9`,<sp/>`0`<sp/>|<sp/>Select<sp/>materials<sp/>(palette<sp/>order<sp/>in<sp/>`materials`<sp/>table).<sp/>|</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">|<sp/>`E`<sp/>|<sp/>Toggle<sp/>**erase**<sp/>tool<sp/>(same<sp/>as<sp/>holding<sp/>right<sp/>mouse<sp/>for<sp/>painting<sp/>mode).<sp/>|</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">|<sp/>`G`<sp/>|<sp/>Toggle<sp/>**stir**<sp/>tool.<sp/>|</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">|<sp/>`-`<sp/>/<sp/>`+`<sp/>(`VK_OEM_MINUS`<sp/>/<sp/>`VK_OEM_PLUS`)<sp/>|<sp/>Decrease<sp/>/<sp/>increase<sp/>brush<sp/>size.<sp/>|</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">|<sp/>**Space**<sp/>|<sp/>Pause<sp/>/<sp/>resume<sp/>simulation.<sp/>|</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">|<sp/>`N`<sp/>|<sp/>Advance<sp/>**one**<sp/>simulation<sp/>tick<sp/>while<sp/>paused.<sp/>|</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">|<sp/>`R`<sp/>|<sp/>Reset<sp/>world<sp/>to<sp/>current<sp/>scene<sp/>preset.<sp/>|</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">|<sp/>**F5**<sp/>|<sp/>Save<sp/>to<sp/>sandbox<sp/>file.<sp/>|</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">|<sp/>**F9**<sp/>|<sp/>Load<sp/>sandbox<sp/>file<sp/>(clears<sp/>velocity,<sp/>pressure,<sp/>and<sp/>other<sp/>flow<sp/>buffers<sp/>on<sp/>GPU).<sp/>|</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">|<sp/>**Esc**<sp/>|<sp/>Open<sp/>**pause**<sp/>menu;<sp/>from<sp/>pause<sp/>open<sp/>**settings**<sp/>(resolution).<sp/>Esc<sp/>backs<sp/>out<sp/>of<sp/>menus.<sp/>|</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">Quit<sp/>is<sp/>via<sp/>the<sp/>pause/settings<sp/>**Exit**<sp/>button<sp/>(`Action::exit`),<sp/>not<sp/>Esc<sp/>alone.</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">###<sp/>HUD<sp/>structure<sp/>(`makeLayout`<sp/>/<sp/>`composeUi`)</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">-<sp/>**Canvas**<sp/>—<sp/>letterboxed<sp/>region<sp/>mapping<sp/>client<sp/>pixels<sp/>to<sp/>world<sp/>coordinates<sp/>(`Layout::worldPoint`).</highlight></codeline>
