<codeline><highlight class="normal">-<sp/>**Footer**<sp/>—<sp/>play/pause,<sp/>step,<sp/>reset,<sp/>save/load,<sp/>tool<sp/>cycle,<sp/>brush<sp/>size<sp/>track.</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">-<sp/>**Cog**<sp/>—<sp/>settings<sp/>while<sp/>running;<sp/>in<sp/>pause<sp/>menu,<sp/>settings<sp/>for<sp/>resolution<sp/>presets<sp/>(1280×800<sp/>…<sp/>2560×1440).</highlight></codeline>
