<codeline><highlight class="normal">-<sp/>**Tooltip**<sp/>—<sp/>hovering<sp/>the<sp/>canvas<sp/>probes<sp/>GPU<sp/>cell<sp/>and<sp/>shows<sp/>dominant<sp/>material.</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">UI<sp/>geometry<sp/>is<sp/>rebuilt<sp/>each<sp/>frame<sp/>from<sp/>window<sp/>size;<sp/>draw<sp/>records<sp/>are<sp/>up<sp/>to<sp/>**`maxQuads`<sp/>(16384)**<sp/>`Quad`<sp/>structs<sp/>(32<sp/>bytes,<sp/>`alignas(16)`)<sp/>uploaded<sp/>to<sp/>a<sp/>per-frame<sp/>storage<sp/>buffer.</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">---</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">##<sp/>Scenes<sp/>and<sp/>layouts<sp/>{#scenes-and-layouts}</highlight></codeline>
