<codeline><highlight class="normal">##<sp/>Save<sp/>format<sp/>{#save-format}</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">`saveWorld`<sp/>/<sp/>`loadWorld`<sp/>(`game.cpp`):</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">-<sp/>Magic:<sp/>**`SAND0001`**<sp/>(8<sp/>bytes).</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">-<sp/>`uint32_t`<sp/>width,<sp/>height<sp/>—<sp/>must<sp/>match<sp/>`worldWidth`<sp/>(384)<sp/>and<sp/>`worldHeight`<sp/>(224).</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">-<sp/>`worldCells`<sp/>×<sp/>**16-byte<sp/>`Cell`**<sp/>records<sp/>(trivially<sp/>copyable,<sp/>GPU-matched<sp/>layout).</highlight></codeline>
