<codeline><highlight class="normal">Writes<sp/>use<sp/>a<sp/>`.tmp`<sp/>sibling<sp/>file<sp/>when<sp/>possible.<sp/>Load<sp/>does<sp/>not<sp/>restore<sp/>velocity<sp/>or<sp/>pressure;<sp/>`VulkanGame::replaceWorld`<sp/>uploads<sp/>cells<sp/>and<sp/>**zero-fills**<sp/>flow/auxiliary<sp/>buffers<sp/>(indices<sp/>2,<sp/>3,<sp/>5,<sp/>6<sp/>in<sp/>storage).</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">Default<sp/>path:<sp/>`%LOCALAPPDATA%\FallingSand\world.sandbox`,<sp/>else<sp/>`./world.sandbox`<sp/>(`saveLocation()`<sp/>in<sp/>`main.cpp`).</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
