<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">##<sp/>Data<sp/>model<sp/>{#data-model}</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">###<sp/>`Cell`<sp/>(CPU<sp/>and<sp/>GPU,<sp/>16<sp/>bytes)</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">```cpp</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">struct<sp/>Cell<sp/>{</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>std::array&lt;float,<sp/>3&gt;<sp/>liquid;<sp/><sp/>//<sp/>x=water,<sp/>y=oil,<sp/>z=lava<sp/>—<sp/>fill<sp/>in<sp/>[0,<sp/>1]</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>std::uint32_t<sp/>matter;<sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>//<sp/>packed<sp/>id,<sp/>age,<sp/>heat</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">};</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">```</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">Shader-side<sp/>mirror<sp/>in<sp/>`world.glsl`<sp/>(`vec3<sp/>liquid`,<sp/>`uint<sp/>matter`).</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">###<sp/>Packed<sp/>`matter`<sp/>word</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">|<sp/>Bits<sp/>|<sp/>Field<sp/>|<sp/>Access<sp/>|</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">|<sp/>---<sp/>|<sp/>---<sp/>|<sp/>---<sp/>|</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">|<sp/>0–7<sp/>|<sp/>Material<sp/>id<sp/>|<sp/>`material(c)`<sp/>→<sp/>`c.matter<sp/>&amp;<sp/>255u`<sp/>|</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">|<sp/>8–15<sp/>|<sp/>Age<sp/>(e.g.<sp/>smoke/fire<sp/>lifetime)<sp/>|<sp/>`age(c)`<sp/>|</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">|<sp/>16–25<sp/>|<sp/>Heat<sp/>(0…1023<sp/>→<sp/>0…1)<sp/>|<sp/>`heat(c)`<sp/>|</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">|<sp/>(upper)<sp/>|<sp/>Remaining<sp/>bits<sp/>unused<sp/>in<sp/>helpers<sp/>|<sp/>`packMatter(id,<sp/>life,<sp/>temperature)`<sp/>|</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">Material<sp/>constants<sp/>(shader<sp/>and<sp/>logic):<sp/>`EMPTY`,<sp/>`SAND`,<sp/>`WATER`,<sp/>`OIL`,<sp/>`STONE`,<sp/>`WOOD`,<sp/>`FIRE`,<sp/>`SMOKE`,<sp/>`STEAM`,<sp/>`LAVA`,<sp/>`ICE`<sp/>(0–10).</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">###<sp/>Liquids</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">-<sp/>Three<sp/>**immiscible<sp/>fill<sp/>channels**<sp/>share<sp/>one<sp/>velocity<sp/>field;<sp/>**separate.comp**<sp/>slowly<sp/>exchanges<sp/>oil/lava<sp/>vs<sp/>water<sp/>between<sp/>staggered<sp/>row<sp/>pairs.</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">-<sp/>`wet(c)`<sp/>when<sp/>total<sp/>liquid<sp/>`volume(c)<sp/>&gt;<sp/>0.028`.</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">-<sp/>**Inverse<sp/>density**<sp/>for<sp/>pressure<sp/>face<sp/>weights<sp/>uses<sp/>channel<sp/>weights<sp/>`(1.0,<sp/>0.78,<sp/>2.3)`<sp/>in<sp/>`inverseDensity`.</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">###<sp/>Solids<sp/>and<sp/>gases</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">-<sp/>`solid(c)`:<sp/>stone,<sp/>wood,<sp/>ice,<sp/>sand<sp/>—<sp/>block<sp/>face<sp/>connections<sp/>via<sp/>`faceWeight`.</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">-<sp/>`gas(id)`:<sp/>fire,<sp/>smoke,<sp/>steam<sp/>—<sp/>handled<sp/>in<sp/>**grains**<sp/>(rise)<sp/>and<sp/>**reaction**.</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">###<sp/>Host<sp/>helpers</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">-<sp/>`makeCell(Material,<sp/>quantity)`<sp/>—<sp/>initial<sp/>paint/scene<sp/>values.</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">-<sp/>`displayMaterial`<sp/>/<sp/>`kind`<sp/>—<sp/>UI<sp/>and<sp/>tooltips<sp/>from<sp/>liquid<sp/>+<sp/>matter.</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">---</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">##<sp/>GPU<sp/>buffers<sp/>and<sp/>ping-pong<sp/>{#gpu-buffers-and-ping-pong}</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">From<sp/>`world.glsl`<sp/>(compute;<sp/>read-only<sp/>subset<sp/>in<sp/>`world.frag`<sp/>via<sp/>`WORLD_READ_ONLY`):</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">|<sp/>Binding<sp/>|<sp/>Buffer<sp/>|<sp/>Role<sp/>|</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">|<sp/>---<sp/>|<sp/>---<sp/>|<sp/>---<sp/>|</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">|<sp/>0–1<sp/>|<sp/>`CellsA`,<sp/>`CellsB`<sp/>|<sp/>Cell<sp/>ping-pong<sp/>(`pc.state`<sp/>selects<sp/>read;<sp/>writes<sp/>use<sp/>`writeCell`<sp/>/<sp/>`writeOther`)<sp/>|</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">|<sp/>2<sp/>|<sp/>`Velocity`<sp/>|<sp/>Staggered-style<sp/>face<sp/>flow<sp/>used<sp/>by<sp/>flux/advect/project<sp/>|</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">|<sp/>3<sp/>|<sp/>`Prediction`<sp/>|<sp/>Predicted<sp/>velocity<sp/>(predict<sp/>pass)<sp/>|</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">|<sp/>4<sp/>|<sp/>`Equations`<sp/>|<sp/>Pressure<sp/>network<sp/>row<sp/>per<sp/>cell<sp/>(`Equation`:<sp/>`vec4<sp/>weights`,<sp/>`float<sp/>rhs`)<sp/>|</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">|<sp/>5–6<sp/>|<sp/>`PressureA`,<sp/>`PressureB`<sp/>|<sp/>Pressure<sp/>ping-pong<sp/>for<sp/>Jacobi<sp/>|</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">|<sp/>7<sp/>|<sp/>`Flux`<sp/>|<sp/>Outward<sp/>liquid<sp/>flux<sp/>per<sp/>cell<sp/>|</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">|<sp/>8–9<sp/>|<sp/>`LimitA`,<sp/>`LimitB`<sp/>|<sp/>Inflow<sp/>capacity<sp/>ping-pong<sp/>for<sp/>limit/advect<sp/>|</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">**Push<sp/>constant<sp/>`Frame`**<sp/>(`world.glsl`):<sp/>grid<sp/>`size`,<sp/>ping-pong<sp/>`state`,<sp/>`tick`,<sp/>`operation`<sp/>(`mode`,<sp/>`phase`,<sp/>`material`,<sp/>spare),<sp/>`brush`<sp/>segment,<sp/>`canvas`<sp/>rect,<sp/>`cursor`<sp/>(world<sp/>xy,<sp/>radius,<sp/>visibility),<sp/>`screen`<sp/>(width,<sp/>height,<sp/>visual<sp/>time).</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">`vulkan.cpp`<sp/>constants:</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">-<sp/>**`pressureBatches<sp/>=<sp/>12`**<sp/>—<sp/>12<sp/>pressure<sp/>dispatches<sp/>per<sp/>tick<sp/>(red-black<sp/>`operation[1]<sp/>=<sp/>pass<sp/>&amp;<sp/>1`).</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">-<sp/>**`fluxLimitPasses<sp/>=<sp/>5`**<sp/>—<sp/>odd<sp/>count<sp/>so<sp/>limit<sp/>field<sp/>settles<sp/>before<sp/>advection.</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">---</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">##<sp/>Frame<sp/>pipeline<sp/>(host)<sp/>{#frame-pipeline-host}</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">Each<sp/>frame<sp/>(`VulkanGame::draw`):</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">1.<sp/>Wait<sp/>on<sp/>frame-in-flight<sp/>fence;<sp/>optional<sp/>timestamp<sp/>readback.</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">2.<sp/>Acquire<sp/>swapchain<sp/>image.</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">3.<sp/>Upload<sp/>**UI<sp/>quads**<sp/>to<sp/>the<sp/>slot’s<sp/>storage<sp/>buffer.</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">4.<sp/>**Compute**<sp/>(if<sp/>stroke<sp/>and/or<sp/>`ticks<sp/>&gt;<sp/>0`):</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/>-<sp/>Optional<sp/>**`brush.comp`**<sp/>for<sp/>the<sp/>current<sp/>stroke.</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/>-<sp/>**`recordSim`**:<sp/>`ticks`<sp/>iterations<sp/>of<sp/>the<sp/>simulation<sp/>chain<sp/>(below).</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">5.<sp/>**Graphics**<sp/>(`recordDraw`):</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/>-<sp/>Barrier:<sp/>compute<sp/>writes<sp/>→<sp/>fragment<sp/>shader<sp/>read.</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/>-<sp/>Dynamic<sp/>rendering:<sp/>clear<sp/>→<sp/>**world**<sp/>pass<sp/>(scissored<sp/>to<sp/>canvas)<sp/>→<sp/>**UI**<sp/>pass<sp/>(full<sp/>window).</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/>-<sp/>Present<sp/>(or<sp/>capture<sp/>BMP<sp/>via<sp/>transfer).</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">Play<sp/>loop<sp/>(`main.cpp`):<sp/>when<sp/>not<sp/>paused,<sp/>accumulates<sp/>real<sp/>time<sp/>and<sp/>runs<sp/>`floor(accumulator<sp/>/<sp/>tickSeconds)`<sp/>ticks<sp/>per<sp/>frame<sp/>(`tickSeconds<sp/>=<sp/>1/90`).<sp/>Paused<sp/>runs<sp/>0<sp/>ticks<sp/>unless<sp/>**N**<sp/>or<sp/>UI<sp/>**step**<sp/>sets<sp/>a<sp/>one-shot<sp/>tick.<sp/>Benchmark/capture<sp/>modes<sp/>force<sp/>**1<sp/>tick/frame**.</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">---</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">##<sp/>Simulation<sp/>tick<sp/>(compute)<sp/>{#simulation-tick-compute}</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">Order<sp/>inside<sp/>**one<sp/>tick**<sp/>(`VulkanGame::Impl::recordSim`<sp/>in<sp/>`vulkan.cpp`).<sp/>Brush<sp/>is<sp/>**outside**<sp/>this<sp/>loop<sp/>and<sp/>runs<sp/>once<sp/>per<sp/>frame<sp/>when<sp/>the<sp/>user<sp/>strokes.</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">|<sp/>Step<sp/>|<sp/>Kernel<sp/>|<sp/>Workgroup<sp/>layout<sp/>|<sp/>What<sp/>it<sp/>does<sp/>|</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">|<sp/>---:<sp/>|<sp/>---<sp/>|<sp/>---<sp/>|<sp/>---<sp/>|</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">|<sp/>1<sp/>|<sp/>**reaction.comp**<sp/>|<sp/>16×8<sp/>|<sp/>Chemistry:<sp/>heat,<sp/>fire,<sp/>quenching,<sp/>melting,<sp/>smoke/steam<sp/>lifetimes;<sp/>updates<sp/>`matter`<sp/>and<sp/>liquid<sp/>mix.<sp/>|</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">|<sp/>—<sp/>|<sp/>`state<sp/>^=<sp/>1`<sp/>|<sp/>—<sp/>|<sp/>Toggle<sp/>cell<sp/>buffer<sp/>ping-pong.<sp/>|</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">|<sp/>2<sp/>|<sp/>**grains.comp**<sp/>|<sp/>16×8<sp/>over<sp/>2×2<sp/>blocks<sp/>|<sp/>Sand<sp/>**falls**,<sp/>gas<sp/>**rises**;<sp/>local<sp/>2×2<sp/>updates<sp/>to<sp/>reduce<sp/>races.<sp/>|</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">|<sp/>3<sp/>|<sp/>**predict.comp**<sp/>|<sp/>16×8<sp/>|<sp/>Semi-Lagrangian<sp/>**velocity<sp/>prediction**<sp/>from<sp/>neighbors,<sp/>viscosity,<sp/>gravity.<sp/>|</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">|<sp/>4<sp/>|<sp/>**equation.comp**<sp/>|<sp/>16×8<sp/>|<sp/>Build<sp/>**pressure<sp/>network<sp/>row**<sp/>per<sp/>wet,<sp/>non-solid<sp/>cell<sp/>(`faceWeight`<sp/>on<sp/>neighbors).<sp/>|</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">|<sp/>5<sp/>|<sp/>**pressure.comp**<sp/>×12<sp/>|<sp/>16×16,<sp/>shared<sp/>mem<sp/>|<sp/>**Jacobi**<sp/>relaxation<sp/>on<sp/>pressure<sp/>(two<sp/>iterations<sp/>per<sp/>dispatch,<sp/>halo<sp/>tile);<sp/>red-black<sp/>phases<sp/>via<sp/>`operation[1]`.<sp/>|</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">|<sp/>6<sp/>|<sp/>**project.comp**<sp/>|<sp/>16×8<sp/>|<sp/>**Project**<sp/>predicted<sp/>velocity<sp/>with<sp/>pressure<sp/>gradients<sp/>(divergence<sp/>reduction).<sp/>|</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">|<sp/>7<sp/>|<sp/>**flux.comp**<sp/>|<sp/>16×8<sp/>|<sp/>Face<sp/>**outward<sp/>liquid<sp/>flux**<sp/>from<sp/>velocity;<sp/>negative<sp/>flow<sp/>pulls<sp/>from<sp/>neighbors.<sp/>|</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">|<sp/>8<sp/>|<sp/>**limit.comp**<sp/>×5<sp/>|<sp/>16×8<sp/>|<sp/>**Inflow<sp/>limits**<sp/>ping-pong<sp/>(`limitA`/`limitB`);<sp/>how<sp/>much<sp/>each<sp/>cell<sp/>can<sp/>accept.<sp/>|</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">|<sp/>9<sp/>|<sp/>**advect.comp**<sp/>|<sp/>16×8<sp/>|<sp/>Move<sp/>**water/oil/lava**<sp/>along<sp/>flux<sp/>subject<sp/>to<sp/>limits;<sp/>writes<sp/>other<sp/>cell<sp/>buffer.<sp/>|</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">|<sp/>—<sp/>|<sp/>`state<sp/>^=<sp/>1`<sp/>|<sp/>—<sp/>|<sp/>Toggle<sp/>cell<sp/>ping-pong<sp/>after<sp/>advection.<sp/>|</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">|<sp/>10<sp/>|<sp/>**separate.comp**<sp/>×2<sp/>|<sp/>16×8,<sp/>half<sp/>height<sp/>dispatch<sp/>|<sp/>**Phase<sp/>separation**<sp/>oil/lava<sp/>vs<sp/>water<sp/>on<sp/>staggered<sp/>rows;<sp/>`operation[1]`<sp/>checkerboard<sp/>with<sp/>`tick`.<sp/>|</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">**brush.comp**<sp/>(when<sp/>painting):<sp/>dispatches<sp/>over<sp/>a<sp/>bounding<sp/>box<sp/>of<sp/>the<sp/>stroke;<sp/>modes<sp/>—<sp/>deposit<sp/>material/liquid,<sp/>erase,<sp/>or<sp/>stir<sp/>(`pc.operation`<sp/>mode<sp/>+<sp/>`pc.brush`<sp/>+<sp/>radius).</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">This<sp/>design<sp/>is<sp/>a<sp/>**bounded,<sp/>real-time<sp/>2D<sp/>fluid<sp/>approximation**:<sp/>shared<sp/>velocity,<sp/>finite<sp/>pressure<sp/>iterations,<sp/>finite-volume<sp/>transport<sp/>with<sp/>donor/receiver<sp/>limits<sp/>—<sp/>suited<sp/>for<sp/>gameplay<sp/>rather<sp/>than<sp/>offline<sp/>CFD<sp/>accuracy.</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">---</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">##<sp/>Rendering<sp/>path<sp/>(graphics)<sp/>{#rendering-path-graphics}</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">|<sp/>Stage<sp/>|<sp/>Shader<sp/>|<sp/>Notes<sp/>|</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">|<sp/>---<sp/>|<sp/>---<sp/>|<sp/>---<sp/>|</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">|<sp/>World<sp/>|<sp/>**fullscreen.vert**<sp/>+<sp/>**world.frag**<sp/>|<sp/>Single<sp/>large<sp/>triangle;<sp/>fragment<sp/>shader<sp/>maps<sp/>canvas<sp/>pixels<sp/>→<sp/>grid<sp/>coords;<sp/>includes<sp/>`world.glsl`<sp/>read-only.<sp/>Shading:<sp/>material/liquid<sp/>reconstruction,<sp/>absorption,<sp/>highlights,<sp/>Fresnel,<sp/>refraction,<sp/>lava<sp/>glow,<sp/>procedural<sp/>noise.<sp/>|</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">|<sp/>UI<sp/>|<sp/>**ui.vert**<sp/>+<sp/>**ui.frag**<sp/>|<sp/>Instanced<sp/>quads<sp/>(`6`<sp/>vertices<sp/>×<sp/>`quadCount`);<sp/>per-quad<sp/>bounds<sp/>+<sp/>RGBA<sp/>from<sp/>CPU<sp/>`Quad`<sp/>list.<sp/>Bitmap<sp/>font<sp/>and<sp/>panels<sp/>drawn<sp/>entirely<sp/>on<sp/>CPU<sp/>in<sp/>`ui.cpp`.<sp/>|</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">Push<sp/>constants<sp/>for<sp/>both<sp/>passes<sp/>share<sp/>`canvas`,<sp/>`cursor`,<sp/>`screen`<sp/>(and<sp/>simulation<sp/>uses<sp/>the<sp/>same<sp/>layout<sp/>block).</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">Pipeline:<sp/>**Vulkan<sp/>dynamic<sp/>rendering**<sp/>(no<sp/>classic<sp/>render<sp/>pass<sp/>object),<sp/>swapchain<sp/>format<sp/>color<sp/>attachment,<sp/>scissor<sp/>for<sp/>world<sp/>letterboxing.</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
