<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">##<sp/>Shared<sp/>shader<sp/>library<sp/>(`world.glsl`)<sp/>{#shared-shader-library-worldglsl}</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">Included<sp/>by<sp/>every<sp/>`.comp`<sp/>and<sp/>by<sp/>`world.frag`<sp/>(with<sp/>`WORLD_READ_ONLY`).</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">-<sp/>**Coordinate<sp/>helpers**:<sp/>`inside`,<sp/>`indexOf`,<sp/>`readCell`,<sp/>`writeCell`,<sp/>`writeOther`.</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">-<sp/>**Material/thermo<sp/>helpers**:<sp/>`packMatter`,<sp/>`solid`,<sp/>`wet`,<sp/>`gas`,<sp/>`faceWeight`,<sp/>`inverseDensity`.</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">-<sp/>**RNG**:<sp/>`hash32`<sp/>/<sp/>`random01`<sp/>for<sp/>stochastic<sp/>grain<sp/>motion.</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">Compute<sp/>shaders<sp/>use<sp/>`#extension<sp/>GL_GOOGLE_include_directive`<sp/>and<sp/>are<sp/>compiled<sp/>as<sp/>Vulkan<sp/>1.3<sp/>SPIR-V.</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">Host<sp/>code<sp/>does<sp/>not<sp/>parse<sp/>GLSL;<sp/>keeping<sp/>`Cell`<sp/>layout<sp/>and<sp/>material<sp/>IDs<sp/>in<sp/>sync<sp/>is<sp/>enforced<sp/>by<sp/>shared<sp/>constants<sp/>and<sp/>static<sp/>asserts<sp/>in<sp/>`game.hpp`.</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
